   "text": "anonymous viewer \u00b7 admin from .env\n\nPAD platform (home dashboard)\n  \u00b7 Overview\n  \u00b7 Services: where is the bottleneck\n  \u00b7 Instances: is the load balanced\n  \u00b7 Logs: what happened\n  \u00b7 Databases (Patroni replication)\n  \u00b7 Sagas (coordinated by the broker)\n\nPAD data warehouse\n  \u00b7 ETL \u00b7 Warehouse\n\ndata sources: Prometheus \u00b7 Loki \u00b7\nwarehouse-db as dw_reader",
   "originalText": "anonymous viewer \u00b7 admin from .env\n\nPAD platform (home dashboard)\n  \u00b7 Overview\n  \u00b7 Services: where is the bottleneck\n  \u00b7 Instances: is the load balanced\n  \u00b7 Logs: what happened\n  \u00b7 Databases (Patroni replication)\n  \u00b7 Sagas (coordinated by the broker)\n\nPAD data warehouse\n  \u00b7 ETL \u00b7 Warehouse\n\ndata sources: Prometheus \u00b7 Loki \u00b7\nwarehouse-db as dw_reader",
